<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Security Warning | QuestCord</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

        body {
            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f0f23 0%, #1a1a2e 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 580px;
            width: 100%;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .warn-icon {
            font-size: 72px;
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: #faa61a;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }

        .subtitle {
            color: #b9bbbe;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.25rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .card.warn-border {
            border-color: rgba(250,166,26,0.35);
            background: rgba(250,166,26,0.05);
        }

        .card.danger-border {
            border-color: rgba(237,66,69,0.35);
            background: rgba(237,66,69,0.05);
        }

        .card-label {
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #72767d;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
            margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        }

        .path-value {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 1rem;
            color: #faa61a;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        .info-value {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #b9bbbe;
        }

        .message {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #b9bbbe;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .message strong { color: #fff; }

        /* Attempts bar */
        .attempts-bar {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin: 0.75rem 0 0.5rem;
        }

        .attempt-dot {
            flex: 1;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }

        .attempt-dot.used { background: #ed4245; }
        .attempt-dot.remaining { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.15); }

        .attempts-text {
            font-size: 0.88rem;
            color: #b9bbbe;
            margin-top: 0.4rem;
        }

        .attempts-text strong {
            color: <%= remaining === 1 ? '#ed4245' : '#faa61a' %>;
        }

        .ip-value {
            font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .back-btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 0.85rem;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 10px;
            color: #b9bbbe;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }

        .back-btn:hover {
            border-color: rgba(88,101,242,0.5);
            color: #fff;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <span class="warn-icon">⚠️</span>
            <h1>Security Warning</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">You have attempted to access a restricted or sensitive path.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card warn-border">
            <div class="card-label">Path Attempted</div>
            <div class="path-value"><%= probedPath %></div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-label">What Happened</div>
            <p class="message">
                The path <strong><%= probedPath %></strong> is a known sensitive location that is actively monitored.
                <strong>There is no sensitive data here.</strong> This access attempt has been logged and flagged.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card <%= remaining === 1 ? 'danger-border' : 'warn-border' %>">
            <div class="card-label">Automatic Ban Warning — Attempt <%= hits %> of <%= threshold %></div>
            <div class="attempts-bar">
                <% for (let i = 0; i < threshold; i++) { %>
                <div class="attempt-dot <%= i < hits ? 'used' : 'remaining' %>"></div>
                <% } %>
            </div>
            <p class="attempts-text">
                <% if (remaining === 1) { %>
                    <strong>Final warning.</strong> One more probe and your IP will be automatically banned for 30 days.
                <% } else { %>
                    <strong><%= remaining %> more probe<%= remaining !== 1 ? 's' : '' %></strong> and your IP will be automatically banned for 30 days.
                <% } %>
            </p>
        </div>

        <% if (ip) { %>
        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-label">Your IP Address</div>
            <div class="ip-value"><%= ip %></div>
        </div>
        <% } %>

        <a href="/" class="back-btn">Return to QuestCord</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
